editor\" data-id=\"8ee8d34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our licensed asbestos removalists follow a thorough and transparent process to minimise disruption and ensure every part of the job meets New South Wales&#8217; safety and environmental standards:<\/p><p><strong>1. Site inspection and assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>We begin by assessing the materials and areas suspected to contain asbestos. This helps us determine the type of asbestos and the safest way to remove it.<\/p><p><strong>2. Safety planning and setup<\/strong><\/p><p>Before removal begins, we prepare the site with safety zones, signage and protective equipment. This keeps everyone on site safe and limits the risk of fibre exposure.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t<\/section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-538f9ce elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"538f9ce\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container container-fluid elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1022688 \" data-id=\"1022688\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64396d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"64396d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\